1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,420
Then they told me, "You should hear yourself

2
00:00:04,820 --> 00:00:07,620
You need a bigger crowd

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:11,300
Be a speaker, hit the road

4
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:16,500
Go say it all out loud"

5
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:23,540
But my body can't go do it, couldn't stand all night on stage

6
00:00:23,540 --> 00:00:26,500
So I put it in a song

7
00:00:27,060 --> 00:00:30,020
And I wrote it on the page

8
00:00:30,500 --> 00:00:33,300
At my place and in my time

9
00:00:34,100 --> 00:00:36,900
Every word I get to write

10
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:44,740
Now your speakers and headphones are my stadium tonight
